# Meter on, at 40 %: 236236d can't come out; testman has no other move for 6d, so p1 just walks forward. No meter is spent.
setup: p1 character testman
setup: p2 character testman
setup: module meter 5000 0 0 0 4000 0
frame 1: p1 2, 3, 6, 2, 3, 6d

frame 6: expect p1 state = walk_forward
frames 1-10: expect module meter[0] = 4000
